    "detailed_description": "<h1>Social Media</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/e06de6945a5e447dbf7981ca7cee1193.avif?t=1751011577\" /></div><br>For the latest game dev updates and chatting with developers, hit up these channels\uff1a<br>Twitter\uff1a<br>Discord\uff1a<br>Youtube\uff1a</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Merchant In Dungeon</strong> is now online, thank you for your support. There are still many problems in the game, but we will carefully record them and plan to fix them in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/04f5c1a7faf71054c956d0ae2553366c.avif?t=1751011577\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Merchant In Dungeon</strong>, crafted by <strong>HexGameStudio</strong>, the creators behind <strong>Dungeon of Dragon Knight</strong> marks their fresh venture into diverse dungeon exploration games within the <strong>Dungeon of Dragon Knight</strong>  universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/400eb3ecbcf57069ba18b722aa11478e.avif?t=1751011577\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, players take on the role of Hercules, starting from scratch by managing a department store to repay debts. You're hands-on, overseeing every aspect from purchasing goods, making sales, to hiring and training staff. Explore mazes, complete tasks to gain new resources and recipes\u2014yet mastering the store is just the beginning. Utilize funds or loans to acquire over 60 diverse shops, invest, train staff, and boost sales to become an economic powerhouse controlling the entire town's economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/1457f8915150dc3e580d685825053de8.poster.avif?t=1751011577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/1457f8915150dc3e580d685825053de8.webm?t=1751011577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/1457f8915150dc3e580d685825053de8.mp4?t=1751011577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Full-Fledged Store Management</strong>\uff1aPlayers need to personally oversee every aspect of store operations, from inventory management to sales strategies, even including staff training and task allocation, requiring careful planning and management. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Diverse Development Paths</strong>\uff1aPlayers can focus on elevating the management level of a single store, pursue multi-store chain operations, or explore other investment directions. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Robust Economic System</strong>\uff1aPlayer decisions will impact the profitability of the stores, including aspects like product selection, pricing, and inventory management. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Character Development and NPC Interaction</strong>\uff1aPlayers can nurture employee skills and specialties to make them more effective in the business process. Increasing rapport through interaction with NPCs can unlock additional resources or opportunities. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Random Events and Challenges</strong>\uff1aVarious random events occur in the game, such as sudden price increases or staff resignations, demanding flexible responses from players. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Game maximum resolution 3840*2160</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/61430e6cc80c19b1ae982b7e212e24e4.poster.avif?t=1751011577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/61430e6cc80c19b1ae982b7e212e24e4.webm?t=1751011577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/61430e6cc80c19b1ae982b7e212e24e4.mp4?t=1751011577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
