/1457f8915150dc3e580d685825053de8.webm?t=1751011577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/1457f8915150dc3e580d685825053de8.mp4?t=1751011577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Full-Fledged Store Management</strong>\uff1aPlayers need to personally oversee every aspect of store operations, from inventory management to sales strategies, even including staff training and task allocation, requiring careful planning and management. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Diverse Development Paths</strong>\uff1aPlayers can focus on elevating the management level of a single store, pursue multi-store chain operations, or explore other investment directions. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Robust Economic System</strong>\uff1aPlayer decisions will impact the profitability of the stores, including aspects like product selection, pricing, and inventory management. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Character Development and NPC Interaction</strong>\uff1aPlayers can nurture employee skills and specialties to make them more effective in the business process. Increasing rapport through interaction with NPCs can unlock additional resources or opportunities. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Random Events and Challenges</strong>\uff1aVarious random events occur in the game, such as sudden price increases or staff resignations, demanding flexible responses from players. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Game maximum resolution 3840*2160</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/61430e6cc80c19b1ae982b7e212e24e4.poster.avif?t=1751011577\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/61430e6cc80c19b1ae982b7e212e24e4.webm?t=1751011577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671490/extras/61430e6cc80c19b1ae982b7e212e24e4.mp4?t=1751011577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Merchant in Dungeon is about managing shops.Hercules enters Dark Gate Town solo, aiming to repay his father's debt. Starting with a store, he grows capital, hires, expands shops, and manages relationships with diverse female NPCs. Dominating the business scene? Quite a challenge!",
